WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Docracy — sign documents over WhatsApp. Phone-bound, PIN-protected.

00:05.000 --> 00:12.000
Step 1: Toggle "Also send via WhatsApp" when preparing a document.

00:12.000 --> 00:20.065
Step 2: Add the signer's WhatsApp number, set a PIN, and choose how to deliver it.

00:20.065 --> 00:29.065
Step 3: Send. The signing link goes straight to their own WhatsApp, not a shared inbox.

00:29.065 --> 00:38.565
Step 4: About thirty seconds later, the PIN arrives as its own message — a real second factor.

00:38.565 --> 00:46.065
Step 5: The signer enters the PIN, then signs — proof of sole control.

00:46.065 --> 00:53.765
Every delivery and read receipt lands in the audit trail, backing the Advanced Electronic Signature claim.

00:53.765 --> 00:58.765
WhatsApp signing — live today at docracy.io.
